Reginald is a runewright at the [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/Hidden Gulch/Haven/Crimson Sigil|Crimson Sigil]] in [[Geography/Althane/Lunae Badlands/Hidden Gulch/Haven/index|Haven]]. He's a middle-aged, blue scaled [[Bestiary/Rule of Beasts#Dray|Dray]] with a reputation for remaining courteous with even the most roughshod customers.
